11
00:54:16,000 --> 00:54:22,000
The film was originally intended to be an adaptation of Marvel Comics' Doctor
Strange, but the studio's rights expired during pre-production.

12
00:59:12,000 --> 00:59:18,000
Full Moon elected to still produce the movie, with the character
renamed, and enough other changes made to avoid a lawsuit.

13
01:04:08,000 --> 01:04:14,000
The film explores themes of new york city,
teleportation, fight, time travel, amulet.

14
